{"id":1060701,"name":"L.L.·审查Ⅰ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"L.L.·审查Ⅰ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1060701]}],"trial":{"trial_id":60701,"stage":"阶段1","unlock_time":"2024-09-10 14:00:00","diary1":"“极乐岛”精神污染事件的最后，你追查到禁闭者L.L.的住处，却发现她已经被人抢先一步带走。\n　　几天后的深夜，你的终端突然收到了一则意义和来源皆不明的乱码讯息。","diary2":"审查中萝尔莱伊向你讲述了她被地底人带走的经历。如今在枷锁的作用下，她虽然已经可以短暂离开水域像普通人一样生活，却依然无法很好地融入线下生活。\n　　萝尔莱伊对此感到非常苦恼，你安慰她不必太过着急，并决定带她离开管理局去看看外面的世界。","evidence":[{"ID":260621,"Num":1},{"ID":260623,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260622,"Num":1},{"ID":260624,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160701023,"next":null},{"step":24